// M0 frozen fixture for the "trivial" golden replay (PLAN §8.3).
//
// The M0 World consumes no part/balance data — the scenario is clock + warp
// commands only — so this stub exists to pin the data-fixture hash to real,
// versioned bytes. When csp-data's loader lands, fixture dirs will hold the
// frozen data sets the golden scenarios actually load; this file is then the
// place the trivial fixture's schema_version is asserted.
(
    schema_version: 1,
)
